        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where cities suddenly fall asleep during the day and wander like sleepwalkers at night, the heroes realize: Morpheus made a mistake and tangled the patterns of dreams. Jason, Medea, and Asclepius unite their powers, brew safe potions, repair dream-guiding lighthouses, and capture nightmares in ancient amphorae. Each night brings new danger, each awakening is a small victory. Only by dispelling the final shiver of a nightmare above the temple will they earn the gratitude of the god of dreams and restore the natural rhythm of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Argonaut Agency is a time-management game with worker assignment: on each level you quickly gather resources (food, wood, etc.), build and upgrade structures (farm, sawmill, workers’ house), clear obstacles, and manage to complete the objectives for ‘3 stars’ before the timer runs out, using temporary boosts (speed-up, time stop, construction speed-up).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The triumphant return of legendary heroes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A great reimagining: Asclepius steps out of his lab!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A warrior saga: the Argonauts battle nightly horrors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enchanting music that evokes Ancient Greece!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Each location brings new challenges and new rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Morpheus’ comics – living dreams that lead you through the story!</p>",
